{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: LLM基础MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"上下文长度管理有哪些策略？如何处理超长文本？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"LLM基础与Prompt工程\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/LLM基础\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">LLM基础MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"上下文长度管理有哪些策略？如何处理超长文本？\" dir=\"auto\">上下文长度管理有哪些策略？如何处理超长文本？</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">LLM 的上下文窗口有限（如 128K），如何处理超长文本？有哪些上下文管理策略？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>一、上下文管理 5 大策略</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ContextManager</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"上下文长度管理器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 策略 1: 滑动窗口 - 保留最近 N 轮</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">sliding_window</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_rounds<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span>max_rounds <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># user + assistant = 1 轮</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 策略 2: 摘要压缩 - 早期轮次压缩为摘要</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">summary_compression</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> threshold<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">4000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        total_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_count_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> total_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;=</span> threshold<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> messages\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 保留 system + 最近对话 + 早期摘要</span>\n        system_msg <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        recent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">6</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 最近 3 轮</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 中间部分压缩</span>\n        middle <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">6</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        summary <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\" Summarize: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>middle<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>system_msg<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"assistant\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"历史摘要: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>summary<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> recent\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 策略 3: 实体记忆提取 - 提取关键信息</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">entity_extraction</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"提取关键实体（用户ID、订单号、偏好等）存入外部记忆\"\"\"</span>\n        entities <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"Extract key entities: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> entities  <span class=\"token comment\"># 存入 Redis/数据库</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 策略 4: RAG 检索 - 只注入相关内容</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">rag_injection</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> documents<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        relevant <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_db<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>search<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> top_k<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>d<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>page_content <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> d <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> relevant<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 策略 5: 分层处理 - 长文档分段处理</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">hierarchical_processing</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> long_document<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"Map-Reduce 风格处理\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># Step 1: 分段摘要（Map）</span>\n        chunks <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_split<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>long_document<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> chunk_size<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">2000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        summaries <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_summarize<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>chunk<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> chunk <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> chunks<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># Step 2: 综合回答（Reduce）</span>\n        combined_summary <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>summaries<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_answer_from_summary<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>combined_summary<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>二、长文本处理技术对比</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口</td>\n<td>保留最近 N 轮</td>\n<td>对话场景</td>\n<td>简单但可能丢失早期信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>摘要压缩</td>\n<td>早期轮次压缩为摘要</td>\n<td>多轮对话</td>\n<td>减少 60-70% token</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RAG 检索</td>\n<td>只注入相关内容</td>\n<td>知识问答</td>\n<td>精准控制上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Map-Reduce</td>\n<td>分段处理再综合</td>\n<td>长文档分析</td>\n<td>可处理任意长度文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无限注意力</td>\n<td>如 Longformer</td>\n<td>特殊架构</td>\n<td>线性复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"128K 上下文够用了吗？\"</strong> — 大多数场景够用，但处理整本书、大规模代码库仍需要 RAG 或分段</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"Lost in the Middle 效应如何应对？\"</strong> — 重要信息放开头或结尾，避免放中间</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">LLM基础MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}